		"viz_info_details": {
			"options": {
				"backgroundColor": "transparent",
				"fontColor": "#2B2B2B",
				"fontSize": "small",
				"markdown": "## Metric Reference — Details & KPI Reference Tab\n\n---\n\n#### Reference Data\n\n**WAN Circuit Bandwidth Reference** — Circuit capacity metadata from configuration\n**Site Reference** — Site names, codes, and metadata from configuration\n\n---\n\n#### Site-Level Analysis\n\n**Top 5 Sites by Issue Count** — Most impacted locations ranked by open issues\n**Network vs Client Issues** — Issue type breakdown (infrastructure vs. client)\n**Week-over-Week Health** — Health score delta from prior week\n**Site-level Health** — Per-site network health score\n\n---\n\n#### Issue Drill-Down\n\n**Top 5 Network Issues** — Most frequent network issues by occurrence\n**Top 5 Client Issues** — Most frequent client issues by occurrence\n**Non-Compliant Devices** — Devices failing Catalyst Center compliance checks\n\n---\n\n#### Topology & Inventory\n\n**AP Count by Location** — Access point distribution per site\n**Switch Count by Location** — Switch distribution per site\n**Site Locations** — Geographic map of monitored sites with live device count\n**Live Network Topology** — Interactive topology view from Catalyst Center\n**Devices by Role** — Distribution by role (access, distribution, core, border, etc.)\n**Live Device Inventory** — Full device list with health, IP, platform, and role"
			},
			"type": "splunk.markdown"
		},
		"viz_info_overview": {
			"options": {
				"backgroundColor": "transparent",
				"fontColor": "#2B2B2B",
				"fontSize": "small",
				"markdown": "## Metric Reference — Overview Tab\n\n---\n\n#### Health & Issues\n\n**Network Health** — Composite network health score from Catalyst Center (0–100)\n**Device Health** — Composite device health score from Catalyst Center (0–100)\n**Open Issues** — Current active issues reported by Catalyst Center\n**Issues By Severity** — Issue distribution by P1 / P2 / P3 / P4 priority\n**Syslog Critical** — Emergency + Critical syslog events from Cisco IOS devices\n**Syslog By Severity** — Full syslog event distribution by severity level\n\n---\n\n#### Inventory & Compliance\n\n**Device Inventory** — Total managed device count in Catalyst Center\n**Inventory with Compliance** — Device count by role overlaid with compliance status\n**Audit Events Today** — Configuration change events detected in the current day\n**Config Change Trend** — Configuration changes over time (Catalyst Center audit)\n**Issue Trend** — Open issue count trending over the selected time range\n**Compliance by Status** — Compliant / Non-Compliant / Not Applicable breakdown\n\n---\n\n#### Trends\n\n**Network Health Trend** — Network health score over time\n**Device Health Trend** — Device health score over time\n**Compliance %** — Policy compliance percentage across all managed devices\n**Audit Events** — Audit event volume over time"
			},
			"type": "splunk.markdown"
		},
